        "A clean, fast, mobile-friendly site built around what your customers actually need to find — your services, your prices, and a way to get in touch or book.",
        "Ongoing edits & support",
        "Opening hours changed? New menu, new price list, new photos? Send us the details and we'll update the site — usually within one working day.",
        "Hosting & security",
        "We host every site on fast, secure UK-based servers, keep software patched, and take daily backups so you're never at risk of losing your site.",
        "Booking & contact forms",
        "Let customers book appointments, request quotes, or get in touch without picking up the phone — enquiries land straight in your inbox.",
        "Local search visibility",
        "We set your site up to be found on Google for the searches that matter locally, and connect it to Google Business Profile.",
        "Online shops & payments",
        "Selling products or taking deposits? We can add secure online payments through Stripe so you can take orders around the clock.",
        "What we do"
